      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "Rates use a fixed **30-second window**. Missing coverage produces gaps, never zero. An empty boundary may be unsupported: consult the run manifest. Observed partial rates and counters are **not final reconciled totals**. Exact totals, run verdict, start/stop and deployment annotations come from the run evidence/operator. Select one component to drill down; inventory includes absent components. Main-run target: **40 GB/s raw decimal** (40,000,000,000 B/s = **37.2529 GiB/s**), for **600 seconds**. This target is not a smoke-run acceptance threshold.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Live estimates \u00b7 coverage and evidence",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / N/A",
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "quantile by(boundary) (0.5, (rate(fibre_bench_raw_bytes_total{role=\"encoder\"}[30s])) and on(component_id,role,region) (fibre_bench_expected_component{run_id=\"$run\",region=~\"$region\",component_id=~\"$component\"} == 1) and on(component_id,role,region) (max by(component_id,role,region) (fibre_bench_identity_info{run_id=\"$run\"} == 1)))",
          "legendFormat": "{{boundary}} median",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "min by(boundary) ((rate(fibre_bench_raw_bytes_total{role=\"encoder\"}[30s])) and on(component_id,role,region) (fibre_bench_expected_component{run_id=\"$run\",region=~\"$region\",component_id=~\"$component\"} == 1) and on(component_id,role,region) (max by(component_id,role,region) (fibre_bench_identity_info{run_id=\"$run\"} == 1)))",
          "legendFormat": "{{boundary}} min",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max by(boundary) ((rate(fibre_bench_raw_bytes_total{role=\"encoder\"}[30s])) and on(component_id,role,region) (fibre_bench_expected_component{run_id=\"$run\",region=~\"$region\",component_id=~\"$component\"} == 1) and on(component_id,role,region) (max by(component_id,role,region) (fibre_bench_identity_info{run_id=\"$run\"} == 1)))",
          "legendFormat": "{{boundary}} max",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Observed per-component rate distribution",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
